4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q4Mq8h8va0MQ7kNvwHOp15l&_nc_oc=AdqfNZL2uZkPbN_i4E4rS9cb3DZG_r27JMKcDCZIYqq-cEgcc790wUfgK0R34J_7bkc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGBTsAY9p-gn3T0rr9ddyBAkgkvzCWRRaptDiiksAhLWg&oe=6A75D7D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wmwNUzx6vD4Q7kNvwF9EEJc&_nc_oc=Ado-ml3MrHg7GGUkN4cnnWmNbs6H4UtYzZWngS9AvGLEveiYtj6ih-mku_F26SSaPm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHLWWwzS5jGNezv4nvm2waRvZ_mAyMoYuAIiE2mQMN8Bw&oe=6A75DCB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nW0uaUYcoG0Q7kNvwG6CM_q&_nc_oc=AdriwqOgkn2pvD36_-OavH2nflVWbnoxJRdnK448_wXGf4qEp3z1GFnDsPUAbSnTsCs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFTN2P0tATZ05Jg_xZ7Aav0HA41OC5JQQsQoW5GWcizNA&oe=6A75EA55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p